│ The issue arises because the resolve_lookup_value method coerces a │
│ list to a tuple, which breaks exact value queries in ORM fields    │
│ like PickledField. The fix involves preserving the original input  │
│ type (list) rather than converting it to a tuple. This ensures     │
│ that the method maintains the expected iterable type as specified  │
│ in the problem description. The change is minimal and directly     │
│ addresses the coercion issue by removing the unnecessary tuple     │
│ conversion.                                                        │
