│ resolve expressions and handle nested values. However, it          │
│ currently coerces the input value (which may be a list or tuple)   │
│ to a tuple. This change breaks exact value queries because ORM     │
│ fields expect the input type to match the expected type (e.g.,     │
│ tuple for PickledField).                                           │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│                           🛠️ Proposed Fix                           │
│                                                                    │
